WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.797 --> 00:00:03.090
- All right, we have one last story

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:04.740
I hope will give you all the feels.

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:05.761
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.761 --> 00:00:08.700
(rock music)

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.490
Moving into a new neighborhood
can be a bit unnerving,

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.890
and that's how one Rhode Island mom felt

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:16.290
whenever she and her
family got their new house.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.360
That is until the man
next door walked over

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.590
and introduced himself.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:22.560
Almost instantly he became
a new member of the family,

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.690
as they say, an honorary grandpa.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.240
We have Sharaine on the line right now

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.980
along with her daughter, Wilson,

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.095
and their neighbor,
Paul, watching on NBC 10.

00:00:32.095 --> 00:00:33.382
Oh my gosh.

00:00:33.382 --> 00:00:36.011
(audience cheers)

00:00:36.011 --> 00:00:36.928
Oh my gosh.

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:40.742
Okay, I'm gonna lead with you, Sharaine,

00:00:40.742 --> 00:00:42.870
more on how did y'all meet?

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.760
Like he just walked over randomly?

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.340
- So, we just bought
our first home last year

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.200
and Paul came over to introduce himself

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.810
and asked my husband if he
needed to borrow a ladder.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:53.400
The rest was history.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.800
Ever since then, Paul has
been over for birthdays,

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.990
holidays, cookouts, Paul's there.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:00:59.460
- I love it.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:02.553
Well, Paul, you like to
entertain kids, right?

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:04.770
- Yep.

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:06.714
Kids say the darnedest things.

00:01:06.714 --> 00:01:07.980
- Oh. (laughs)

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:08.823
Yeah.

00:01:08.823 --> 00:01:09.810
- They have no rules or regulations.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.520
They just say whatever there is.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.740
- They really do say
whatever is in their mind.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.810
Just ask my son anytime I exit my house.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:16.777
He's like, "Oh, you're wearing that?

00:01:16.777 --> 00:01:18.030
"That's a choice."
(audience laughs)

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:20.550
I'm like, okay, that's really fun.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:23.010
But Wilson, what's one
of your favorite things

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:24.750
about having Paul as a neighbor?

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:28.920
- I like when he brings over some snacks,

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:31.429
and I like when he has fun with us

00:01:31.429 --> 00:01:34.047
and I like when he takes his teeth out.

00:01:34.047 --> 00:01:38.700
- Oh my God, Wilson,
you have my whole heart.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.440
You are so adorable.

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:42.930
Oh my gosh, it was so
lovely to meet all of you.

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:45.090
Thank you so much,
Sharaine, Paul, and Wilson.

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:47.081
I'm liking your post right now.

00:01:47.081 --> 00:01:48.602
- [Sharaine] Thank you.

00:01:48.602 --> 00:01:49.646
(audience cheers)

00:01:49.646 --> 00:01:50.790
- And that's not all.

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:53.520
Our season long partner
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:55.110
the Go-to pen of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.870
want to honor truly good
neighbors, just like all y'all.

00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:00.420
So, they're gonna be writing
you a check for $1,000.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:03.582
That's 500 for Sharaine and 500 for Paul.

00:02:03.582 --> 00:02:04.449
There you go!

00:02:04.449 --> 00:02:06.026
(audience clapping)

00:02:06.026 --> 00:02:07.566
- Oh my god, thank you.

00:02:07.566 --> 00:02:09.478
- All right, thank y'all so much.

00:02:09.478 --> 00:02:11.070
Thank you to all our guests this hour.

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:16.070
Jacob Elordi, Jose Andres,
Elias, Audrey, and Lauren Cerand.

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:17.063
Y'all have a great day,

00:02:17.063 --> 00:02:19.050
and if it's not, try and change it.

